Exhale a wave of dark fire with radius [5, 7, 8, 9, 9 (TL1-5)], lasting 4 turns. Any non-demon caught in the area will take [119, 154, 180, 202, 221 (TL1-5; STR 100)] fire damage, and flames will be left dealing a further [28, 36, 42, 47, 52 (TL1-5; STR 100)] each turn. Demons will be healed for the same amount.

The damage will increase with your Strength Stat, but critically hit as a spell.
